{"event_type":"review","id":"3b7596432b3a81e9d7f14a494443f4c399cff13080286ef89557e53db28b7286","occurred_at":"2026-11-09T20:44:39Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8675fd3024a8e6208b91b129c9b3919dcbf7ce3222b7d9de71d41e8ffc4d6c0d","sha256":"8675fd3024a8e6208b91b129c9b3919dcbf7ce3222b7d9de71d41e8ffc4d6c0d"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1db456918fe5ca889dd91ae280e2a8214c03914c8d25f41c4d757b2bc409884b","sha256":"1db456918fe5ca889dd91ae280e2a8214c03914c8d25f41c4d757b2bc409884b"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2d41571dc6078881e7f5a423f014b8fe577f75fbc3d655b2c67641f46f5bd6c3","sha256":"2d41571dc6078881e7f5a423f014b8fe577f75fbc3d655b2c67641f46f5bd6c3"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4fc8d3b5f6de018ebe8bbfa1b5836b0c6a3feab76ab84ab181836ca28b441807","sha256":"4fc8d3b5f6de018ebe8bbfa1b5836b0c6a3feab76ab84ab181836ca28b441807"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b95e6cd8b79e669211e4a104fc336a196801e6bb2a246ead689f463b410cb326","sha256":"b95e6cd8b79e669211e4a104fc336a196801e6bb2a246ead689f463b410cb326"}],"attempt_id":"3ec1d5481249f9427c55f6b6578f9603f4bc939a5529e27724f36242a15a7283:0:1","base":"4e865d07501f4a08e68db04d063831199e9c2978","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"0fdfbb365006a8b9ef6a6d1396baf2a7fb60c7ca","body":"**`harvest(dry=True)` runs real verification side effects.**\n\nAt repair_tick.py:343-356, the FIXED branch has no `dry` guard. A dry pass therefore still does these things:\n\n- It calls `c.make_worktree('verify-' + job_id, ...)`.\n- It runs `verify`.\n- It loads `crq_repair.py`.\n- It calls `module.mechanical`. That call writes `repair.patch` into `state/repair/<job>/` and runs the `cq_bin` hack detector.\n\nEvery other mutation in `harvest` is gated by `if not dry`, including `mark_finding_outcome`, the `record.update` calls, and cleanup. If verification raises during a dry pass, the exception also propagates out of the dry call. Gate the verification on `not dry`, and keep the `predecessor` chaining so the dry pass still produces its \"would harvest\" message.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-            if result.get('verdict') == 'FIXED':\n+            if result.get('verdict') == 'FIXED' and not dry:\n                 # Later findings move the shared HEAD; validate each immutable\n                 # claimed range through a separate detached verification worktree.\n                 check_wt, branch = c.make_worktree('verify-' + job_id, commits[-1])\n                 try:\n                     ...\n                 finally:\n                     c.remove_worktree(check_wt, branch)\n+            if result.get('verdict') == 'FIXED':\n                 predecessor = commits[-1]\n```\n</details>","id":"057d1896a5736beed48b940c0c1ca8318afad398a2183769596c455caf4290b9","intervals":[[343,356]],"path":"apps/crq-python/repair_tick.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"`harvest(dry=True)` runs real verification side effects."}],"head":"65caba2c227d0c5bad90dac8230a9c811dc911f0","head_tree":"26c3b0934808252bdcdb6b4602387f222cc522cf","input_scope":[{"blob":"69f36799a8308a8fb15466cac02c3b463d57dbb1","intervals":[[1,799]],"path":"apps/crq-python/crq_repair.py"},{"blob":"0fdfbb365006a8b9ef6a6d1396baf2a7fb60c7ca","intervals":[[1,904]],"path":"apps/crq-python/repair_tick.py"},{"blob":"889a62710dd7ee65bb5fcc980aec2ef054b0bd02","intervals":[[1,429]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_repair_bounded.py"},{"blob":"53ecc6dccd40d68cde04bb44ad89a77b164d79f9","intervals":[[1,1444]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_repair_drain.py"},{"blob":"a60c14d6945d36ba49709643d993f08a23b4aeb7","intervals":[[1,182]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_repair_recovery.py"}],"job_id":"